<EditionBanner
  edition="September 2026 edition"
  revisedDate="2026-09-17"
  note="First published July 2026; re-published September 18, 2026. This full September rewrite follows two external reviews and a failure in my own deployment process. The July argument centered on registries becoming supply chains. This edition sharpens the boundary: approving an artifact doesn't establish that a particular use is trustworthy. The distinction below is the September argument, not a claim about what the July essay already said."
